################################################################################
# FCGames — fluxo completo de ponta a ponta, rodando na AWS (não local)
#
# Usa com a extensão "REST Client" (VS Code) ou o HTTP Client (Rider/IntelliJ).
# Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco, NA ORDEM. O token e os IDs são
# referenciados automaticamente das respostas anteriores ({{login.response...}}).
#
# Pré-requisito: nenhum — os 3 serviços já estão deployados e saudáveis.
#   UsersAPI    -> API Gateway -> ECS (fcg-users-cluster)
#   CatalogAPI  -> API Gateway -> ECS (fcg-catalog-cluster) + Worker (consumer)
#   PaymentsAPI -> API Gateway -> ECS (fcg-payments-cluster) + Worker (consumer)
# Mensageria: Amazon SQS + SNS (não RabbitMQ — só local/docker-compose usa RabbitMQ).
#
# NotificationsAPI NÃO está deployada na AWS ainda (só local via docker-compose) —
# não tem passo dela aqui.
#
# Como acompanhar a mensageria (a UI não mostra nada — é tudo assíncrono via SQS/SNS):
#   AWS_PROFILE=fcg-team aws logs tail /ecs/fcg-catalog-service --since 2m --follow
#   AWS_PROFILE=fcg-team aws logs tail /ecs/fcg-payments-service --since 2m --follow
#   (procure por "Bus started", "Configured endpoint", "R-FAULT" e as linhas de
#    Serilog dos consumers — "Pedido {PedidoId} aprovado", etc.)
################################################################################

@users = https://1ipnp7vn16.execute-api.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com
@catalog = https://e0wcpyuyna.execute-api.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com
@payments = https://ke768yj141.execute-api.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com

### 1) Cadastra um usuário  -> publica UsuarioCriadoEvento no SNS
#    Consumido por: CatalogAPI Worker (cria Biblioteca vazia, idempotente por UsuarioId)
# @name cadastro
POST {{users}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "rogers",
  "email": "rogers-aws@teste.com",
  "senha": "rogers@123"
}

### 2) Login  -> retorna o token JWT
# @name login
POST {{users}}/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rogers-aws@teste.com",
  "senha": "rogers@123"
}

### 3) Lista os jogos (seed no DynamoDB)  -> veja os IDs/precos retornados
# @name jogos
GET {{catalog}}/jogos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 4) COMPRA APROVADA (ajuste o índice [0] pra um jogo com preço <= 100)
#    -> CatalogAPI publica PedidoRealizadoEvento no SNS
#    -> PaymentsAPI Worker consome, aprova (preço <= 100), publica PagamentoProcessadoEvento
#    -> CatalogAPI Worker consome, marca Pedido Aprovado + adiciona na Biblioteca
# @name compraAprovada
POST {{catalog}}/compras
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jogoId": "{{jogos.response.body.$[0].id}}"
}

### 5) COMPRA REJEITADA (ajuste o índice [1] pra um jogo com preço > 100)
# @name compraRejeitada
POST {{catalog}}/compras
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jogoId": "{{jogos.response.body.$[1].id}}"
}

### 6) Consulta o pedido aprovado
#    AGUARDE uns 5-10s após #4 antes de rodar — o ciclo completo (SNS->SQS->Worker
#    payments->SNS->SQS->Worker catalog) é assíncrono e mais lento que localhost.
#    Se ainda estiver "Pendente", espere mais um pouco e rode de novo.
GET {{catalog}}/compras/{{compraAprovada.response.body.$.orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 7) Consulta o pagamento correspondente
GET {{payments}}/pagamentos/{{compraAprovada.response.body.$.orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 8) Biblioteca do usuário  -> deve conter o jogo da compra aprovada
GET {{catalog}}/biblioteca/{{cadastro.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

################################################################################
# Fluxo de Admin (jogos são [Authorize Admin])
# Admin seedado: admin@fcgames.com / Admin@123
################################################################################

### Login do admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{users}}/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fcgames.com",
  "senha": "Admin@123"
}

### Cria um novo jogo (somente Admin)
POST {{catalog}}/jogos
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Stardew Valley",
  "descricao": "Fazendinha relaxante",
  "preco": 24.90
}

################################################################################
# Health checks
################################################################################

### users
GET {{users}}/health

### catalog
GET {{catalog}}/health

### payments
GET {{payments}}/health
